Here is the commit message:
Another bug fix

Fixed a bug introduced in d37442c which was causing the menu to not show
up in singleplayer

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by a change in the logic that determined when the game should pause when the escape key is pressed. The original condition only checked if a level was not loading, which did not account for the scenario where the game was in singleplayer mode and the menu needed to be displayed. This oversight led to the menu not showing up when it should have.

